<title>USA: Medford Savings sets special cash div.</title>
<headline>Medford Savings sets special cash div.</headline>
<dateline>MEDFORD, Mass. 1996-11-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Medford Savings Bank said Wednesday it has set a special cash dividend of $0.15 per share for shareholders of record as of December 13.</p>
<p>The special dividend will be paid out January 15, along with a regular quarterly dividend of $0.17 per share.</p>
<p>The special cash dividend represents a 25 percent increase over last year's special dividend, the company said.</p>
</text>
